{"type":"message","id":"0f65ae86","parentId":"f8a20d30","timestamp":"2026-03-18T23:53:03.802Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_eva9h1laylon5srlcuh1kxem","toolName":"process","content":[{"type":"text","text":"r\n获取个人ESP32+BMP280传感器的天气数据\n  - version: 1.0.0\nweather-py  Polymarket Weather Trader\n  - Trade Polymarket weather markets using NOAA forecasts via Simmer API. Inspired by gopfan2's $2M+ strategy. Use when user wants to trade temperature markets,...\n通过Simmer API使用NOAA预报交易Polymarket天气市场，受gopfan2超200万美元策略启发。适用于温度合约交易。\n  - version: 0.1.0\nweather-like-test  Weather Like Test\n  - Get current weather and forecasts (no API key required).\n获取当前天气和预报，无需API密钥。\n  - version: 0.1.0\nweather-1-0-0  Weather 1.0.0\n  - Provide current weather and forecasts using wttr.in and Open-Meteo APIs without requiring an API key.\n使用 wttr.in 和 Open-Meteo API 免密钥获取实时天气与预报。\n  - version: 1.0.0\nweather-open-meteo  Weather Open‑Meteo\n  - Get current weather and forecasts via open-meteo.com with optional fallback to wttr.in if available. No API key required.\n通过 open-meteo.com 获取天气和预报，支持 wttr.in 备用，无需 API 密钥。\n  - version: 0.1.5\nweather-nws  Weather NWS\n  - US weather forecasts via National Weather Service (NWS) with automatic fallback to global weather for non-US locations. Provides detailed accumulation data,...\n美国国家气象局美国天气预报，非美地区自动切换全球天气，含详细累积数据。\n  - version: 1.0.3\nweather-trader  weather-agent\n  - Trade Polymarket US temperature markets using NOAA forecasts with dynamic confidence, quality filtering, and smart trade sizing for improved accuracy and ris...\n基于NOAA预报交易Polymarket美国气温市场，具备动态置信度、质量过滤与智能仓位管理，提升准确性与风险控制\n  - version: 1.0.4\nweather-zh  中国城市天气Weather In China\n  - 中文天气查询工具 - 使用中国天气网获取实时天气（无需API密钥，不依赖大模型）\n中文天气查询工具 - 使用中国天气网获取实时天气（无需API密钥，不依赖大模型）\n  - version: 0.1.3\nweather-intelligence-digest-fresh  Weather Intelligence Digest Fresh\n  - Generate daily Weather Intelligence Digest using NOAA/NWS data with customizable locations and alert monitoring.\n基于NOAA/NWS数据生成每日天气简报，支持自定义地点和预警监控。\n  - version: 1.0.0\nweather-digest  Weather Digest\n  - Generate daily Weather Intelligence Digest using NOAA/NWS data with customizable locations and alert monitoring.\n基于NOAA/NWS数据生成每日天气简报，支持自定义地点与预警监控。\n  - version: 1.0.0\n\n\nProcess exited with code 0."}],"details":{"status":"completed","sessionId":"ember-coral","exitCode":0,"aggregated":"You can use \"skillhub install [skill]\" to install.\nweather  Weather\n  - Get current weather and forecasts (no API key required).\n获取当前天气和预报（无需API密钥）\n  - version: 1.0.0\nmaomao-weather  weather\n  - 查询全球任何城市的当前天气情况。当用户询问天气、查询城市温度、了解气象状况时使用此技能。支持中文、英文、拼音输入，自动匹配最佳位置。默认查询北京。\n查询全球任何城市的当前天气情况。当用户询问天气、查询城市温度、了解气象状况时使用此技能。支持中文、英文、拼音输入，自动匹配最佳位置。默认查询北京。\n  - version: 1.0.2\nfree-weather-api  weather\n  - 查询指定城市或地区的天气预报信息，包括温度、天气状况、降水概率、风力风向等。支持实时天气和未来多日预报查询。\n查询指定城市或地区的天气预报信息，包括温度、天气状况、降水概率、风力风向等。支持实时天气和未来多日预报查询。\n  - version: 1.0.0\nweather-pollen  Weather Pollen\n  - Weather and pollen reports for any location using free APIs. Get current conditions, forecasts, and pollen data.\n使用免费API查询任意地点的天气与花粉信息，获取实时状况、预报及花粉数据。\n  - version: 1.0.3\nweathercli  Weathercli\n  - Get current weather conditions and forecasts for any location worldwide. Returns structured data with temperature, humidity, wind, precipitation, and more. No API key required.\n获取全球任意地点的当前天气及预报，返回温度、湿度、风速、降水等结构化数据，无需API密钥。\n  - version: 0.1.0\nweather-infographic  Weather TV style\n  - Generate a TV-style weather infographic with a location-specific seasonal background. Use when the user asks for a visual weather forecast or a weather infographic for a specific address.\n生成电视风格天气信息图，含地点特定季节背景。用于用户请求可视化天气预报或特定地址天气图表时。\n  - version: 1.0.2\nweather-cn  中国城市天气Weather in China\n  - 中文天气查询工具 - 使用中国天气网获取实时天气（无需API密钥，不依赖大模型）\n中文天气查询工具 - 使用中国天气网获取实时天气（无需API密钥，不依赖大模型）\n  - version: 1.0.1\nweather-api  Weather Api\n  - Fetch weather data for construction scheduling. Historical data, forecasts, and risk assessment for outdoor work.\n获取施工排程天气数据，提供历史记录、预报及户外作业风险评估。\n  - version: 2.1.0\nweatherkit  WeatherKit\n  - Access Apple WeatherKit REST API for detailed weather forecasts using JWT authentication.\n通过 JWT 认证访问 Apple WeatherKit REST API 获取详细天气预报。\n  - version: 1.0.0\nweather-api-1  Weather Api 1\n  - Fetch weather data for construction scheduling. Historical data, forecasts, and risk assessment for outdoor work.\n获取施工排期天气数据，包括历史数据、预报及户外作业风险评估。\n  - version: 1.0.1\nweather-esp32  weatheresp32\n  - Get weather data from your personal ESP32+BMP280 sensor\n获取个人ESP32+BMP280传感器的天气数据\n  - version: 1.0.0\nweather-py  Polymarket Weather Trader\n  - Trade Polymarket weather markets using NOAA forecasts via Simmer API. Inspired by gopfan2's $2M+ strategy. Use when user wants to trade temperature markets,...\n通过Simmer API使用NOAA预报交易Polymarket天气市场，受gopfan2超200万美元策略启发。适用于温度合约交易。\n  - version: 0.1.0\nweather-like-test  Weather Like Test\n  - Get current weather and forecasts (no API key required).\n获取当前天气和预报，无需API密钥。\n  - version: 0.1.0\nweather-1-0-0  Weather 1.0.0\n  - Provide current weather and forecasts using wttr.in and Open-Meteo APIs without requiring an API key.\n使用 wttr.in 和 Open-Meteo API 免密钥获取实时天气与预报。\n  - version: 1.0.0\nweather-open-meteo  Weather Open‑Meteo\n  - Get current weather and forecasts via open-meteo.com with optional fallback to wttr.in if available. No API key required.\n通过 open-meteo.com 获取天气和预报，支持 wttr.in 备用，无需 API 密钥。\n  - version: 0.1.5\nweather-nws  Weather NWS\n  - US weather forecasts via National Weather Service (NWS) with automatic fallback to global weather for non-US locations. Provides detailed accumulation data,...\n美国国家气象局美国天气预报，非美地区自动切换全球天气，含详细累积数据。\n  - version: 1.0.3\nweather-trader  weather-agent\n  - Trade Polymarket US temperature markets using NOAA forecasts with dynamic confidence, quality filtering, and smart trade sizing for improved accuracy and ris...\n基于NOAA预报交易Polymarket美国气温市场，具备动态置信度、质量过滤与智能仓位管理，提升准确性与风险控制\n  - version: 1.0.4\nweather-zh  中国城市天气Weather In China\n  - 中文天气查询工具 - 使用中国天气网获取实时天气（无需API密钥，不依赖大模型）\n中文天气查询工具 - 使用中国天气网获取实时天气（无需API密钥，不依赖大模型）\n  - version: 0.1.3\nweather-intelligence-digest-fresh  Weather Intelligence Digest Fresh\n  - Generate daily Weather Intelligence Digest using NOAA/NWS data with customizable locations and alert monitoring.\n基于NOAA/NWS数据生成每日天气简报，支持自定义地点和预警监控。\n  - version: 1.0.0\nweather-digest  Weather Digest\n  - Generate daily Weather Intelligence Digest using NOAA/NWS data with customizable locations and alert monitoring.\n基于NOAA/NWS数据生成每日天气简报，支持自定义地点与预警监控。\n  - version: 1.0.0\n","name":"skillhub search"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1773877983799}}
