{"type":"message","id":"47f890fe","parentId":"23148971","timestamp":"2026-03-18T23:53:34.913Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"很好！我看到已经安装了 `weather` 技能，版本 1.0.0。这个技能应该就是之前提到的 \"Get current weather and forecasts (no API key required)\"。\n\n现在让我使用这个已安装的 weather 技能来检查天气。首先，我需要查看这个技能的 SKILL.md 文件：\n\n\n\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_kpldf835ut2j7vh28xfy0deo","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/weather/SKILL.md"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"arkcode","model":"deepseek-v3.2","usage":{"input":26370,"output":122,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":26492,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773878005985}}
{"type":"message","id":"cc926aba","parentId":"47f890fe","timestamp":"2026-03-18T23:53:34.921Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_kpldf835ut2j7vh28xfy0deo","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: weather\ndescription: Get current weather and forecasts (no API key required).\nhomepage: https://wttr.in/:help\nmetadata: {\"clawdbot\":{\"emoji\":\"🌤️\",\"requires\":{\"bins\":[\"curl\"]}}}\n---\n\n# Weather\n\nTwo free services, no API keys needed.\n\n## wttr.in (primary)\n\nQuick one-liner:\n```bash\ncurl -s \"wttr.in/London?format=3\"\n# Output: London: ⛅️ +8°C\n```\n\nCompact format:\n```bash\ncurl -s \"wttr.in/London?format=%l:+%c+%t+%h+%w\"\n# Output: London: ⛅️ +8°C 71% ↙5km/h\n```\n\nFull forecast:\n```bash\ncurl -s \"wttr.in/London?T\"\n```\n\nFormat codes: `%c` condition · `%t` temp · `%h` humidity · `%w` wind · `%l` location · `%m` moon\n\nTips:\n- URL-encode spaces: `wttr.in/New+York`\n- Airport codes: `wttr.in/JFK`\n- Units: `?m` (metric) `?u` (USCS)\n- Today only: `?1` · Current only: `?0`\n- PNG: `curl -s \"wttr.in/Berlin.png\" -o /tmp/weather.png`\n\n## Open-Meteo (fallback, JSON)\n\nFree, no key, good for programmatic use:\n```bash\ncurl -s \"https://api.open-meteo.com/v1/forecast?latitude=51.5&longitude=-0.12&current_weather=true\"\n```\n\nFind coordinates for a city, then query. Returns JSON with temp, windspeed, weathercode.\n\nDocs: https://open-meteo.com/en/docs\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773878014919}}
{"type":"message","id":"cc44d051","parentId":"cc926aba","timestamp":"2026-03-18T23:53:46.789Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"完美！现在我知道如何使用 weather 技能了。根据主人的位置（中国上海），让我检查上海的天气。现在时间是7:52 AM，接近主人的工作时间开始，了解天气对一天的计划很重要。\n\n让我使用 wttr.in 服务检查上海天气：\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_9fl6x5vo54s6kyemwoiu4790","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s \"wttr.in/Shanghai?format=%l:+%c+%t+%h+%w&m\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"arkcode","model":"deepseek-v3.2","usage":{"input":26921,"output":124,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":27045,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773878014921}}
