{"type":"message","id":"ed30e2b4","parentId":"17bef7c3","timestamp":"2026-03-19T02:24:51.244Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"我看到上次更新是在 9:54 AM，现在已经是 10:24 AM，距离上次更新已经过了30分钟。现在我需要检查哪些项目距离上次检查最久。\n\n让我检查时间戳：\n1. email: 1773824000 (很旧)\n2. calendar: 1773824000 (很旧)\n3. weather: 1773861840 (相对较新，大约是7:54 AM)\n4. mentions: null (从未检查过)\n\n从时间戳看，email 和 calendar 是最旧的。现在是10:24 AM，主人已经工作了两个多小时。我应该检查日历和邮件，因为这些是最有价值且最旧的项目。\n\n让我先检查今天的 memory 文件，看看是否有紧急事项：\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_oa37ow7jf5qtzrv78vrzh9pr","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-03-19.md"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"arkcode","model":"deepseek-v3.2","usage":{"input":27879,"output":210,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":28089,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773887079273}}
{"type":"message","id":"af9dbabd","parentId":"ed30e2b4","timestamp":"2026-03-19T02:24:51.252Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_oa37ow7jf5qtzrv78vrzh9pr","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# 2026-03-19\n\n## 今日重点\n- \n\n## 已完成\n- \n\n## 进行中\n- \n\n## 待跟进\n- [ ] \n\n## 决策 / 结论\n- \n\n## 备注\n- 04:22 AM - 心跳检查完成，无事需提醒\n- 04:52 AM - 心跳检查完成，无事需提醒\n- 05:22 AM - 心跳检查完成，无事需提醒\n- 05:52 AM - 心跳检查完成，无事需提醒\n- 06:22 AM - 心跳检查完成，无事需提醒\n- 06:52 AM - 心跳检查完成，无事需提醒\n- 07:22 AM - 心跳检查完成，无事需提醒\n- 07:52 AM - 天气检查：上海 ⛅️ +8°C 87% ↓9km/h\n- 08:24 AM - 心跳检查完成，天气更新：上海 ⛅️ +9°C 81% ↓10km/h\n- 08:54 AM - 心跳检查完成，天气更新：上海 ⛅️ +9°C 81% ↓10km/h\n- 09:24 AM - 心跳检查完成，检查每日简报技能\n- 09:54 AM - 心跳检查完成，天气更新：上海 ⛅️ +9°C 74% ↓10km/h\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773887091249}}
{"type":"message","id":"8c6a36a7","parentId":"af9dbabd","timestamp":"2026-03-19T02:25:02.427Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"我看到今天已经有多次心跳检查和天气更新记录。现在是10:24 AM，主人已经工作了一段时间。\n\n根据规则，我应该检查距离上次最久、且最有价值的项目：\n1. email: 1773824000 (最旧)\n2. calendar: 1773824000 (同样很旧)\n\n这两个都是高价值项目，而且都很久没有检查了。让我先检查日历，因为可能会有即将到来的日程安排。\n\n不过，我需要先了解主人使用什么日历系统。让我搜索一下是否有日历相关的技能：\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_wbgv1d496llmu8cpkzwfynh3","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"skillhub search calendar"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"arkcode","model":"deepseek-v3.2","usage":{"input":28411,"output":152,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":28563,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773887091251}}
{"type":"message","id":"fd0bf501","parentId":"8c6a36a7","timestamp":"2026-03-19T02:25:05.592Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_wbgv1d496llmu8cpkzwfynh3","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You can use \"skillhub install [skill]\" to install.\nws-calendar  Calendar\n  - 日程管理。创建日程、设置提醒、查看安排。\n日程管理。创建日程、设置提醒、查看安排。\n  - version: 1.0.0\ncalendar-scheduling  calendar-scheduling\n  - Schedule meetings, check availability, and manage calendars across Google, Outlook, and CalDAV. Routes to focused sub-skills for datetime resolution and cale...\n跨Google、Outlook和CalDAV平台安排会议、检查空闲时间并管理日历，可路由至专注日期时间解析的子技能。\n  - version: 0.9.1\ncalendar-manager  Calendar Manager\n  - 日历管理技能 - 让 AI 能够读取日程、创建事件、设置提醒。当用户要求查看日程、添加日历事件、提醒 upcoming events 时触发此技能。\n日历管理技能 - 让 AI 能够读取日程、创建事件、设置提醒。当用户要求查看日程、添加日历事件、提醒 upcoming events 时触发此技能。\n  - version: 1.1.0\ncalendar-hold-sync  Calendar Hold Sync\n  - Sync one or more source Google calendars into private Busy hold events in one or more target calendars using gog. Use when users need idempotent double-booki...\n使用 gog 将源 Google 日历同步至目标日历，生成私密忙碌事件以防止重复预订，支持幂等操作。\n  - version: 1.0.1\ncalendar-reminder  Calendar Reminder 日历提醒\n  - 每晚22:00自动扫描明天的Outlook日历，上午日程提前2小时提醒，下午日程12:00统一提醒，通过飞书发送通知。依赖 owa-outlook skill。\n每晚22:00自动扫描明天的Outlook日历，上午日程提前2小时提醒，下午日程12:00统一提醒，通过飞书发送通知。依赖 owa-outlook skill。\n  - version: 1.0.0\ncalendar-planner-cn  Calendar Planner Cn\n  - 日程规划工具。周计划、月计划、时间块、会议安排、截止日期管理、工作生活平衡。Calendar planner with weekly, monthly, time-blocking, meeting scheduling, deadline management, and work-life balance. U...\n日程规划工具。周计划、月计划、时间块、会议安排、截止日期管理、工作生活平衡。Calendar planner with weekly, monthly, time-blocking, meeting scheduling, deadline management, and work-life balance. U...\n  - version: 2.3.5\ncalendar-planner-pro  Calendar Planner Pro\n  - 日程规划工具。周计划、月计划、时间块、会议安排、截止日期管理、工作生活平衡。Calendar planner with weekly, monthly, time-blocking, meeting scheduling, deadline management, and work-life balance. U...\n日程规划工具。周计划、月计划、时间块、会议安排、截止日期管理、工作生活平衡。Calendar planner with weekly, monthly, time-blocking, meeting scheduling, deadline management, and work-life balance. U...\n  - version: 1.0.6\ncalendar-planner  Calendar Planner\n  - Plan work and life across Google Calendar, Outlook, Apple Calendar, and CalDAV with CLI adapters, conflict repair, and weekly reviews.\n使用 CLI 适配器跨 Google、Outlook、Apple 和 CalDAV 日历规划工作与生活，支持冲突修复和周回顾。\n  - version: 1.0.0\ncalendarhero  Calendarhero\n  - CalendarHero integration. Manage Persons, Meetings. Use when the user wants to interact with CalendarHero data.\nCalendarHero 集成。管理联系人和会议，用于与 CalendarHero 数据交互。\n  - version: 1.0.2\ngog  Gog\n  - Google Workspace CLI for Gmail, Calendar, Drive, Contacts, Sheets, and Docs.\nGoogle Workspace 命令行工具，支持 Gmail、日历、云端硬盘、通讯录、表格和文档。\n  - version: 1.0.0\ncaldav-calendar-1-0-1  Caldav Calendar 1.0.1\n  - Sync and query CalDAV calendars (iCloud, Google, Fastmail, Nextcloud, etc.) using vdirsyncer + khal. Works on Linux.\n使用 vdirsyncer + khal 同步和查询 CalDAV 日历（iCloud、Google、Fastmail、Nextcloud 等）。适用于 Linux。\n  - version: 1.0.0\nsocial-media-content-calendar  Social Media Content Calendar\n  - Generate structured social media content calendars with platform-specific posts, hashtags, and scheduling. Use when creating social media plans, content calendars, or social media management deliverables for clients.\n生成结构化社媒内容日历，含平台专属帖子、话题标签及排期。适用于制定社媒计划、内容日历或客户社媒管理交付物。\n  - version: 1.0.0\nyandex-calendar  yandex-calendar\n  - Управляйте Яндекс.Календарём через CalDAV: просматривайте, добавляйте и ищите события с синхронизацией через vdirsyncer и khal.\n通过 CalDAV 管理 Yandex 日历，使用 vdirsyncer 和 khal 同步，查看、添加和搜索事件。\n  - version: 1.0.0\ntaiwan-calendar  Taiwan Calendar Plugin\n  - Taiwan calendar query for accurate working day/holiday information. Use when user asks about Taiwan dates, working days, holidays, make-up workdays, or needs date calculations. Solves Claude's knowledge cutoff issues with Taiwan's administrative calendar.\n台湾行政日历查询，提供准确的工作日、假日及补班日信息。适用于日期计算、工作日查询等场景，解决知识截止日期限制。\n  - version: 0.0.1\napple-calendar-cli  Apple Calendar CLI\n  - Manage Apple Calendar events on macOS 14+ using apple-calendar-cli: list, get, create, update, and delete events with ISO 8601 date support.\n使用 apple-calendar-cli 在 macOS 14+ 上管理 Apple Calendar 事件，支持增删改查及 ISO 8601 日期格式。\n  - version: 1.0.1\nlunar-calendar  Lunar Calendar\n  - 中国农历/阴历的专业查询工具。\n核心能力：\n- 公历转农历（干支纪年、生肖、闰月标志）\n- 农历转公历（支持闰月精准转换）\n- 黄历宜忌查询（嫁娶、动土、开市等）\n- 节气查询（24节气精准到秒级）\n触发场景：当用户询问\"农历\"、\"黄历\"、\"宜忌\"、\"阴历\"、\"八字基础\"、\"春节日期\"、\"闰月\"或需要处理中国传统历法计算时强制激活。\n输出物：结构化日期信息 + 宜忌表 + 节气标识。\n中国农历/阴历的专业查询工具。\n核心能力：\n- 公历转农历（干支纪年、生肖、闰月标志）\n- 农历转公历（支持闰月精准转换）\n- 黄历宜忌查询（嫁娶、动土、开市等）\n- 节气查询（24节气精准到秒级）\n触发场景：当用户询问\"农历\"、\"黄历\"、\"宜忌\"、\"阴历\"、\"八字基础\"、\"春节日期\"、\"闰月\"或需要处理中国传统历法计算时强制激活。\n输出物：结构化日期信息 + 宜忌表 + 节气标识。\n  - version: 0.9.0\ndingtalk-calendar  Dingtalk Calendar\n  - 钉钉日程管理（创建日程、查询闲忙、会议室预订）。使用 mcporter CLI 连接钉钉 MCP server 执行日程管理、日程查询、会议室预订等操作。使用场景：日程创建管理、会议预订、查询他人闲忙、会议室预约等。\n钉钉日程管理（创建日程、查询闲忙、会议室预订）。使用 mcporter CLI 连接钉钉 MCP server 执行日程管理、日程查询、会议室预订等操作。使用场景：日程创建管理、会议预订、查询他人闲忙、会议室预约等。\n  - version: 1.0.2\nafrexai-email-to-calendar  Email to Calendar Extraction Engine\n  - Extract calendar events, deadlines, action items, and follow-ups from emails. Works with any calendar provider (Google, Outlook, Apple, Notion, etc.). No external dependencies — pure agent intelligence. Use when the user forwards an email, asks to check inbox for events, or wants to extract structured scheduling data from any text.\n从邮件中提取日历事件、截止日期、行动项及跟进事项。兼容 Google、Outlook、Apple、Notion 等任意日历服务。无外部依赖，纯智能体能力。适用于用户转发邮件、检查收件箱或从文本提取结构化日程数据的场景。\n  - version: 1.0.0\nbriefing  Briefing (Calendar Agenda, Weather, Pending To-Dos)\n  - Daily briefing: gathers today's calendar, active todos, and local weather from available workspace tools, then composes a concise summary.\n每日简报：收集今日日程、待办事项及本地天气，生成简洁摘要。\n  - version: 2.1.0\nzoom-calendar  Zoom + Google Calendar\n  - Create Zoom meetings and add them to Google Calendar events with proper conferenceData (icon, video entry, notes). Use when creating calendar events with Zoo...\n创建 Zoom 会议并添加到 Google 日历事件，配置会议数据（图标、视频入口、备注）。用于创建带 Zoom 的日历事件。\n  - version: 1.0.0"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":3160,"aggregated":"You can use \"skillhub install [skill]\" to install.\nws-calendar  Calendar\n  - 日程管理。创建日程、设置提醒、查看安排。\n日程管理。创建日程、设置提醒、查看安排。\n  - version: 1.0.0\ncalendar-scheduling  calendar-scheduling\n  - Schedule meetings, check availability, and manage calendars across Google, Outlook, and CalDAV. Routes to focused sub-skills for datetime resolution and cale...\n跨Google、Outlook和CalDAV平台安排会议、检查空闲时间并管理日历，可路由至专注日期时间解析的子技能。\n  - version: 0.9.1\ncalendar-manager  Calendar Manager\n  - 日历管理技能 - 让 AI 能够读取日程、创建事件、设置提醒。当用户要求查看日程、添加日历事件、提醒 upcoming events 时触发此技能。\n日历管理技能 - 让 AI 能够读取日程、创建事件、设置提醒。当用户要求查看日程、添加日历事件、提醒 upcoming events 时触发此技能。\n  - version: 1.1.0\ncalendar-hold-sync  Calendar Hold Sync\n  - Sync one or more source Google calendars into private Busy hold events in one or more target calendars using gog. Use when users need idempotent double-booki...\n使用 gog 将源 Google 日历同步至目标日历，生成私密忙碌事件以防止重复预订，支持幂等操作。\n  - version: 1.0.1\ncalendar-reminder  Calendar Reminder 日历提醒\n  - 每晚22:00自动扫描明天的Outlook日历，上午日程提前2小时提醒，下午日程12:00统一提醒，通过飞书发送通知。依赖 owa-outlook skill。\n每晚22:00自动扫描明天的Outlook日历，上午日程提前2小时提醒，下午日程12:00统一提醒，通过飞书发送通知。依赖 owa-outlook skill。\n  - version: 1.0.0\ncalendar-planner-cn  Calendar Planner Cn\n  - 日程规划工具。周计划、月计划、时间块、会议安排、截止日期管理、工作生活平衡。Calendar planner with weekly, monthly, time-blocking, meeting scheduling, deadline management, and work-life balance. U...\n日程规划工具。周计划、月计划、时间块、会议安排、截止日期管理、工作生活平衡。Calendar planner with weekly, monthly, time-blocking, meeting scheduling, deadline management, and work-life balance. U...\n  - version: 2.3.5\ncalendar-planner-pro  Calendar Planner Pro\n  - 日程规划工具。周计划、月计划、时间块、会议安排、截止日期管理、工作生活平衡。Calendar planner with weekly, monthly, time-blocking, meeting scheduling, deadline management, and work-life balance. U...\n日程规划工具。周计划、月计划、时间块、会议安排、截止日期管理、工作生活平衡。Calendar planner with weekly, monthly, time-blocking, meeting scheduling, deadline management, and work-life balance. U...\n  - version: 1.0.6\ncalendar-planner  Calendar Planner\n  - Plan work and life across Google Calendar, Outlook, Apple Calendar, and CalDAV with CLI adapters, conflict repair, and weekly reviews.\n使用 CLI 适配器跨 Google、Outlook、Apple 和 CalDAV 日历规划工作与生活，支持冲突修复和周回顾。\n  - version: 1.0.0\ncalendarhero  Calendarhero\n  - CalendarHero integration. Manage Persons, Meetings. Use when the user wants to interact with CalendarHero data.\nCalendarHero 集成。管理联系人和会议，用于与 CalendarHero 数据交互。\n  - version: 1.0.2\ngog  Gog\n  - Google Workspace CLI for Gmail, Calendar, Drive, Contacts, Sheets, and Docs.\nGoogle Workspace 命令行工具，支持 Gmail、日历、云端硬盘、通讯录、表格和文档。\n  - version: 1.0.0\ncaldav-calendar-1-0-1  Caldav Calendar 1.0.1\n  - Sync and query CalDAV calendars (iCloud, Google, Fastmail, Nextcloud, etc.) using vdirsyncer + khal. Works on Linux.\n使用 vdirsyncer + khal 同步和查询 CalDAV 日历（iCloud、Google、Fastmail、Nextcloud 等）。适用于 Linux。\n  - version: 1.0.0\nsocial-media-content-calendar  Social Media Content Calendar\n  - Generate structured social media content calendars with platform-specific posts, hashtags, and scheduling. Use when creating social media plans, content calendars, or social media management deliverables for clients.\n生成结构化社媒内容日历，含平台专属帖子、话题标签及排期。适用于制定社媒计划、内容日历或客户社媒管理交付物。\n  - version: 1.0.0\nyandex-calendar  yandex-calendar\n  - Управляйте Яндекс.Календарём через CalDAV: просматривайте, добавляйте и ищите события с синхронизацией через vdirsyncer и khal.\n通过 CalDAV 管理 Yandex 日历，使用 vdirsyncer 和 khal 同步，查看、添加和搜索事件。\n  - version: 1.0.0\ntaiwan-calendar  Taiwan Calendar Plugin\n  - Taiwan calendar query for accurate working day/holiday information. Use when user asks about Taiwan dates, working days, holidays, make-up workdays, or needs date calculations. Solves Claude's knowledge cutoff issues with Taiwan's administrative calendar.\n台湾行政日历查询，提供准确的工作日、假日及补班日信息。适用于日期计算、工作日查询等场景，解决知识截止日期限制。\n  - version: 0.0.1\napple-calendar-cli  Apple Calendar CLI\n  - Manage Apple Calendar events on macOS 14+ using apple-calendar-cli: list, get, create, update, and delete events with ISO 8601 date support.\n使用 apple-calendar-cli 在 macOS 14+ 上管理 Apple Calendar 事件，支持增删改查及 ISO 8601 日期格式。\n  - version: 1.0.1\nlunar-calendar  Lunar Calendar\n  - 中国农历/阴历的专业查询工具。\n核心能力：\n- 公历转农历（干支纪年、生肖、闰月标志）\n- 农历转公历（支持闰月精准转换）\n- 黄历宜忌查询（嫁娶、动土、开市等）\n- 节气查询（24节气精准到秒级）\n触发场景：当用户询问\"农历\"、\"黄历\"、\"宜忌\"、\"阴历\"、\"八字基础\"、\"春节日期\"、\"闰月\"或需要处理中国传统历法计算时强制激活。\n输出物：结构化日期信息 + 宜忌表 + 节气标识。\n中国农历/阴历的专业查询工具。\n核心能力：\n- 公历转农历（干支纪年、生肖、闰月标志）\n- 农历转公历（支持闰月精准转换）\n- 黄历宜忌查询（嫁娶、动土、开市等）\n- 节气查询（24节气精准到秒级）\n触发场景：当用户询问\"农历\"、\"黄历\"、\"宜忌\"、\"阴历\"、\"八字基础\"、\"春节日期\"、\"闰月\"或需要处理中国传统历法计算时强制激活。\n输出物：结构化日期信息 + 宜忌表 + 节气标识。\n  - version: 0.9.0\ndingtalk-calendar  Dingtalk Calendar\n  - 钉钉日程管理（创建日程、查询闲忙、会议室预订）。使用 mcporter CLI 连接钉钉 MCP server 执行日程管理、日程查询、会议室预订等操作。使用场景：日程创建管理、会议预订、查询他人闲忙、会议室预约等。\n钉钉日程管理（创建日程、查询闲忙、会议室预订）。使用 mcporter CLI 连接钉钉 MCP server 执行日程管理、日程查询、会议室预订等操作。使用场景：日程创建管理、会议预订、查询他人闲忙、会议室预约等。\n  - version: 1.0.2\nafrexai-email-to-calendar  Email to Calendar Extraction Engine\n  - Extract calendar events, deadlines, action items, and follow-ups from emails. Works with any calendar provider (Google, Outlook, Apple, Notion, etc.). No external dependencies — pure agent intelligence. Use when the user forwards an email, asks to check inbox for events, or wants to extract structured scheduling data from any text.\n从邮件中提取日历事件、截止日期、行动项及跟进事项。兼容 Google、Outlook、Apple、Notion 等任意日历服务。无外部依赖，纯智能体能力。适用于用户转发邮件、检查收件箱或从文本提取结构化日程数据的场景。\n  - version: 1.0.0\nbriefing  Briefing (Calendar Agenda, Weather, Pending To-Dos)\n  - Daily briefing: gathers today's calendar, active todos, and local weather from available workspace tools, then composes a concise summary.\n每日简报：收集今日日程、待办事项及本地天气，生成简洁摘要。\n  - version: 2.1.0\nzoom-calendar  Zoom + Google Calendar\n  - Create Zoom meetings and add them to Google Calendar events with proper conferenceData (icon, video entry, notes). Use when creating calendar events with Zoo...\n创建 Zoom 会议并添加到 Google 日历事件，配置会议数据（图标、视频入口、备注）。用于创建带 Zoom 的日历事件。\n  - version: 1.0.0","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1773887105589}}
{"type":"message","id":"ea2041a3","parentId":"fd0bf501","timestamp":"2026-03-19T02:25:13.549Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"很好！我找到了几个日历相关的技能。我看到有一个 `briefing` 技能，版本 2.1.0，描述是\"每日简报：收集今日日程、待办事项及本地天气，生成简洁摘要\"。这个看起来很合适，可以一次性检查多个项目。\n\n让我检查一下这个技能是否已经安装：\n\n\n\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_qedrfifl1lk9d7j7um5sllni","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"skillhub list | grep briefing"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"arkcode","model":"deepseek-v3.2","usage":{"input":30663,"output":113,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":30776,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773887105591}}
