{"type":"message","id":"1067f97f","parentId":"8f81f585","timestamp":"2026-03-19T02:25:57.619Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_8htm5dud0umu3nmno2zuqvy4","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"agent-browser  0.2.0\narticle-to-infographic  1.0.0\nbriefing  2.1.0\ncapability-evolver  1.29.5\nfind-skills  0.1.0\ngithub  1.0.0\nliang-tavily-search  1.0.1\nmulti-search-engine  2.0.1\nobsidian  1.0.0\nself-improving-agent  1.0.11\nskill-vetter  1.0.0\nsummarize  1.0.0\ntavily-search  1.0.0\nweather  1.0.0"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":1069,"aggregated":"agent-browser  0.2.0\narticle-to-infographic  1.0.0\nbriefing  2.1.0\ncapability-evolver  1.29.5\nfind-skills  0.1.0\ngithub  1.0.0\nliang-tavily-search  1.0.1\nmulti-search-engine  2.0.1\nobsidian  1.0.0\nself-improving-agent  1.0.11\nskill-vetter  1.0.0\nsummarize  1.0.0\ntavily-search  1.0.0\nweather  1.0.0","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1773887157616}}
{"type":"message","id":"eff7ea07","parentId":"1067f97f","timestamp":"2026-03-19T02:26:12.485Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"我看到了 `weather` 技能，但不是 `openmeteo-sh-weather-simple`。根据 briefing 技能的说明，如果没有可用的伴生技能，就不能生成简报。\n\n现在让我检查主人是否已经安装了其他日历或待办事项管理技能。让我搜索一下是否有其他可用的技能：\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_3r4x0mrkl24p2h27by7al9cq","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"skillhub search todo"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"arkcode","model":"deepseek-v3.2","usage":{"input":32360,"output":108,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":32468,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773887157618}}
{"type":"message","id":"d6fa1f75","parentId":"eff7ea07","timestamp":"2026-03-19T02:26:15.416Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_3r4x0mrkl24p2h27by7al9cq","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You can use \"skillhub install [skill]\" to install.\ntodo  Todo\n  - Personal execution engine for tasks, projects, reminders, commitments, follow-ups, and next actions. Use whenever the user mentions something they need to do...\n个人执行引擎，用于任务、项目、提醒、承诺、跟进及下一步行动。当用户提及需完成事项时使用。\n  - version: 3.0.1\ntodoist  Todoist\n  - Manage tasks and projects in Todoist. Use when user asks about tasks, to-dos, reminders, or productivity.\n管理Todoist任务和项目。适用于任务、待办、提醒或生产力相关查询。\n  - version: 0.2.1\ntodoist-api  Todoist\n  - Todoist API integration with managed OAuth. Manage tasks, projects, sections, labels, and comments. Use this skill when users want to create, update, complet...\nTodoist API集成（托管OAuth），管理任务、项目、分区、标签和评论。适用于创建、更新、完成...等操作。\n  - version: 1.0.3\ntodo-tracker  TODO Tracker\n  - Persistent TODO scratch pad for tracking tasks across sessions. Use when user says \"add to TODO\", \"what's on the TODO\", \"mark X done\", \"show TODO list\", \"remove from TODO\", or asks about pending tasks. Also triggers on heartbeat to remind about stale items.\n跨会话持久化的待办备忘录。响应\"添加/查看/完成/移除待办\"等指令或询问待处理任务时触发。支持心跳机制提醒过期事项。\n  - version: 1.0.0\ntodo-management  Todo management\n  - Per-workspace SQLite todo manager (./todo.db) with groups and task statuses (pending/in_progress/done/skipped), operated via {baseDir}/scripts/todo.sh for adding, listing, editing, moving, and removing entries and managing groups.\n工作区级SQLite待办管理器(./todo.db)，支持分组及任务状态(待处理/进行中/已完成/已跳过)，通过{baseDir}/scripts/todo.sh实现条目增删改查、移动及分组管理。\n  - version: 1.1.3\ntodoist-cli  Todoist CLI\n  - Manage Todoist tasks, projects, labels, and sections via the `todoist` CLI. Use when a user asks to add/complete/list tasks, show today's tasks, search tasks, or manage projects.\n通过 `todoist` CLI 管理 Todoist 任务、项目、标签和分区。用于添加、完成、列出或搜索任务，查看今日任务及管理项目。\n  - version: 1.3.0\ntodoist-natural-language  Todoist Natural Language\n  - Integrate with Todoist task management using natural language. Use when the user wants to manage Todoist tasks or projects through conversational commands li...\n通过自然语言集成Todoist，用于对话式管理任务或项目。\n  - version: 1.0.8\ntodo-management-1-1-2  Todo Management 1.1.2\n  - Per-workspace SQLite todo manager (./todo.db) with groups and task statuses (pending/in_progress/done/skipped), operated via {baseDir}/scripts/todo.sh for adding, listing, editing, moving, and removing entries and managing groups.\n工作区级SQLite待办管理器(./todo.db)，支持分组及任务状态(待处理/进行中/已完成/已跳过)，通过{baseDir}/scripts/todo.sh实现条目增删改移及分组管理。\n  - version: 1.0.0\ntodoist-task-manager  Todoist Task Manager\n  - Manage Todoist tasks via the `todoist` CLI (list, add, modify, complete, delete). Supports filters, projects, labels, and priorities.\n通过 `todoist` CLI 管理 Todoist 任务（列出、添加、修改、完成、删除），支持筛选器、项目、标签和优先级。\n  - version: 1.0.0\ntodoist-rs  todoist latest\n  - Manage Todoist tasks. Use when the user mentions \"todoist\", \"my tasks\", \"task list\", \"add a task\", \"complete task\", or wants to interact with their Todoist account.\n管理 Todoist 任务。当用户提及\"todoist\"、\"我的任务\"、\"任务列表\"、\"添加任务\"、\"完成任务\"或需操作其 Todoist 账户时使用。\n  - version: 1.0.1\ntodozi  Todozi - Your Ai Task Manager\n  - Todozi Eisenhower matrix API client + LangChain tools. Create matrices, tasks, goals, notes; list/search/update; bulk operations; webhooks. Categories: do, done, dream, delegate, defer, dont.\nTodozi艾森豪威尔矩阵API客户端+LangChain工具。创建/列表/搜索/更新矩阵、任务、目标、笔记；批量操作；Webhook。分类：执行、已完成、梦想、委托、推迟、不做。\n  - version: 1.0.0\ntodo-skill  Todo Skill\n  - A skill to break large tasks into smaller actionable steps, optimize execution for each step, and dynamically adapt based on progress.\n将大任务拆解为可执行步骤，分步优化执行，并根据进度动态调整。\n  - version: 1.0.0\ntodoist-td  Todoist\n  - Use the td (Todoist CLI) to read and manage Todoist todos/to-dos/tasks from the terminal. Trigger when the user asks about their todos/tasks/agenda/checklist (today/upcoming/overdue), wants to list inbox/tasks/projects/labels, add a task/todo with natural language, or update/complete/delete/move tasks (e.g., add a phone number to a task description, change due dates, priorities, labels).\n使用 td (Todoist CLI) 在终端管理 Todoist 任务。当用户查询待办（今日/将到期/逾期）、列出收件箱/项目/标签、用自然语言添加任务，或更新/完成/删除/移动任务（如修改描述、截止日期、优先级）时触发。\n  - version: 0.1.1\ntodoist-manager  Todoist Manager\n  - Manage Todoist tasks, projects, labels, and comments via the todoist CLI wrapper. Use when a user asks to add tasks, list todos, complete items, manage projects, or interact with their Todoist account.\n通过 Todoist CLI 工具管理任务、项目、标签和评论，支持添加、查看、完成任务及项目管理等操作。\n  - version: 1.0.0\ntodo-manager  Todo Manager\n  - 管理待办事项。添加、查看、完成、删除待办。\n管理待办事项。添加、查看、完成、删除待办。\n  - version: 1.0.0\ntodoist-visibility  Todoist 任务可见性管理\n  - 基于 Todoist 的任务可见性管理。用于创建、更新和追踪任务状态（进行中🟡、等待中🟠、已完成🟢），并记录进度评论。当用户提到 Todoist 任务管理、任务状态追踪、或需要使用 Todoist API 时触发。\n基于 Todoist 的任务可见性管理。用于创建、更新和追踪任务状态（进行中🟡、等待中🟠、已完成🟢），并记录进度评论。当用户提到 Todoist 任务管理、任务状态追踪、或需要使用 Todoist API 时触发。\n  - version: 1.0.0\ntodo-boss  Todo Boss\n  - Capture and track tasks with owner and due date, mark done, list open or delegated tasks, and get daily reports via Telegram commands.\n通过 Telegram 命令管理任务：记录追踪（含负责人与截止日期）、标记完成、查看待办或已委派任务及每日报告。\n  - version: 0.1.0\ntodolist-md-clawdbot  Todolist Md Clawdbot\n  - Read, summarize, propose edits, and write back changes for Markdown todo files using line-stable bot markers without altering task identity.\n读取、总结 Markdown 待办文件，提议编辑并使用行稳定机器人标记写回更改，不改变任务标识。\n  - version: 1.0.0\ntodolist-md-clawdbot-copy  Todolist Md Clawdbot Copy\n  - Read, summarize, propose edits, and write back changes to Markdown todo files using line-stable bot markers without altering task identity or completing tasks.\n读取、总结 Markdown 待办文件，提出编辑建议并使用行稳定机器人标记写回更改，不改变任务标识或完成任务。\n  - version: 1.0.0\ntodoist-v1  Todoist v1 API Reference\n  - Manage Todoist tasks — list, create, complete, update, and organize tasks and projects.\n管理 Todoist 任务——列出、创建、完成、更新和整理任务与项目。\n  - version: 1.0.0"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":2927,"aggregated":"You can use \"skillhub install [skill]\" to install.\ntodo  Todo\n  - Personal execution engine for tasks, projects, reminders, commitments, follow-ups, and next actions. Use whenever the user mentions something they need to do...\n个人执行引擎，用于任务、项目、提醒、承诺、跟进及下一步行动。当用户提及需完成事项时使用。\n  - version: 3.0.1\ntodoist  Todoist\n  - Manage tasks and projects in Todoist. Use when user asks about tasks, to-dos, reminders, or productivity.\n管理Todoist任务和项目。适用于任务、待办、提醒或生产力相关查询。\n  - version: 0.2.1\ntodoist-api  Todoist\n  - Todoist API integration with managed OAuth. Manage tasks, projects, sections, labels, and comments. Use this skill when users want to create, update, complet...\nTodoist API集成（托管OAuth），管理任务、项目、分区、标签和评论。适用于创建、更新、完成...等操作。\n  - version: 1.0.3\ntodo-tracker  TODO Tracker\n  - Persistent TODO scratch pad for tracking tasks across sessions. Use when user says \"add to TODO\", \"what's on the TODO\", \"mark X done\", \"show TODO list\", \"remove from TODO\", or asks about pending tasks. Also triggers on heartbeat to remind about stale items.\n跨会话持久化的待办备忘录。响应\"添加/查看/完成/移除待办\"等指令或询问待处理任务时触发。支持心跳机制提醒过期事项。\n  - version: 1.0.0\ntodo-management  Todo management\n  - Per-workspace SQLite todo manager (./todo.db) with groups and task statuses (pending/in_progress/done/skipped), operated via {baseDir}/scripts/todo.sh for adding, listing, editing, moving, and removing entries and managing groups.\n工作区级SQLite待办管理器(./todo.db)，支持分组及任务状态(待处理/进行中/已完成/已跳过)，通过{baseDir}/scripts/todo.sh实现条目增删改查、移动及分组管理。\n  - version: 1.1.3\ntodoist-cli  Todoist CLI\n  - Manage Todoist tasks, projects, labels, and sections via the `todoist` CLI. Use when a user asks to add/complete/list tasks, show today's tasks, search tasks, or manage projects.\n通过 `todoist` CLI 管理 Todoist 任务、项目、标签和分区。用于添加、完成、列出或搜索任务，查看今日任务及管理项目。\n  - version: 1.3.0\ntodoi