{"type":"message","id":"87b6fb3e","parentId":"482ad0b2","timestamp":"2026-03-19T02:26:54.538Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"好的，天气更新了：上海现在是⛅️ +10°C 76% ↓10km/h。相比7:52 AM的+8°C，温度有所上升。\n\n现在让我检查今天的 memory 文件，看看是否需要添加任何待办事项或提醒。根据主人的工作习惯，他可能在9点前需要晨报推送。现在是10:24 AM，已经过了晨报时间。\n\n让我更新 memory 文件：\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_gqnfdwaeinkuek21aap979av","name":"edit","arguments":{"path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-03-19.md","oldText":"- 09:54 AM - 心跳检查完成，天气更新：上海 ⛅️ +9°C 74% ↓10km/h","newText":"- 09:54 AM - 心跳检查完成，天气更新：上海 ⛅️ +9°C 74% ↓10km/h\n- 10:24 AM - 心跳检查完成，天气更新：上海 ⛅️ +10°C 76% ↓10km/h"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"arkcode","model":"deepseek-v3.2","usage":{"input":34692,"output":277,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":34969,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773887191085}}
